WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:01.839
- Hey everyone.

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:04.625
It's me, your friend Matt.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:08.805
I just filmed an episode
of Whine About It so I'm trashed.

00:00:08.805 --> 00:00:10.686
Legally speaking.

00:00:10.686 --> 00:00:12.613
In case you hadn't heard,

00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:16.189
I'm nominated for a People's Choice Award

00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:19.044
for favorite social media star,

00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:22.133
which means you have to vote for me

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.804
if you want me to win,

00:00:23.804 --> 00:00:25.406
which you should

00:00:25.406 --> 00:00:27.496
because I deserve this.

00:00:27.496 --> 00:00:30.538
So to help you make your decision,

00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:34.439
I put together a list
of the top 10 reasons

00:00:34.439 --> 00:00:37.504
I should win a People's Choice Award.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:38.711
Alright, here we go.

00:00:38.711 --> 00:00:39.640
One,

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.623
so I can go to the awards
and I can meet Meryl Streep

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:45.249
and then I can convince her

00:00:45.249 --> 00:00:47.060
that we should live together,

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.567
cuddling in our goose feather bed

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.122
in our cottage down by the river.

00:00:52.122 --> 00:00:52.934
Two,

00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:55.883
so I can use it as a pickup line at bars

00:00:55.883 --> 00:00:59.853
and then I can have something
hard to hold onto at night

00:00:59.853 --> 00:01:02.083
when I get rejected.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.197
Three,

00:01:03.197 --> 00:01:05.798
so I can cut in line at Mcdonald's

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:08.305
because fact, every award winner

00:01:08.305 --> 00:01:10.674
gets to go to the front
of the line at Mcdonald's

00:01:10.674 --> 00:01:12.694
and they can order whatever they want.

00:01:12.694 --> 00:01:15.453
You can ask Mcdonald's
and they'll tell you

00:01:15.453 --> 00:01:17.635
Matt can come to our
store whenever he wants.

00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:21.072
He can cut to the front of the
line if he's an award winner,

00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:23.161
which I plan on being.

00:01:23.161 --> 00:01:23.974
Four,

00:01:23.974 --> 00:01:27.132
so I can use it to cut my fine cheese

00:01:27.132 --> 00:01:29.129
or to stab someone.

00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:30.174
Five,

00:01:30.174 --> 00:01:31.869
because Justin Timberlake shouldn't have

00:01:31.869 --> 00:01:33.401
more awards than me.

00:01:33.401 --> 00:01:35.096
If we're being honest here,

00:01:35.096 --> 00:01:37.975
it's time that we even
this shit out, Justin.

00:01:37.975 --> 00:01:39.136
I'm sick of it.

00:01:39.136 --> 00:01:40.343
Six,

00:01:40.343 --> 00:01:43.780
what happens if I go to the
bathroom at the awards show

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:47.193
and Chris Pratt sees me
and I don't have an award?

00:01:47.193 --> 00:01:49.329
And then Chris Pratt is like who's this

00:01:49.329 --> 00:01:52.533
loaf of Wonder Bread without an award?

00:01:52.533 --> 00:01:53.602
Seven,

00:01:53.602 --> 00:01:56.225
so I can tell my doctor
that I've been drinking

00:01:56.225 --> 00:01:58.060
a whole bottle of wine a week

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:01.960
and it's not an unnecessary
medical nightmare

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.723
on my path to self destruction.

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:05.652
Eight,

00:02:05.652 --> 00:02:10.250
so I can wear fancy dress and heels

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.780
and then I get on stage and
the fashion police is like

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:16.217
(gasps) who is she?

00:02:16.217 --> 00:02:17.610
Then it's me.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.794
Nine,

00:02:18.794 --> 00:02:21.534
so I can meet Zac Efron and convince him

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:24.158
to let me sleep at the end of his bed.

00:02:24.158 --> 00:02:25.342
And 10,

00:02:25.342 --> 00:02:29.057
because if I don't win,
I'll stop making videos.

00:02:29.057 --> 00:02:31.750
I swear to god, I'll shut this shit down

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.072
so fast if I don't win.

00:02:34.072 --> 00:02:35.651
You watch me.

00:02:35.651 --> 00:02:37.857
I'll put an end to it.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:41.688
And that's why I should
win People's Choice Award

00:02:41.688 --> 00:02:44.196
for favorite social media star.

00:02:44.196 --> 00:02:45.589
Thank you for watching.

00:02:45.589 --> 00:02:47.446
I'll see you next time.

